{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09817","headline":"奉陪封大夫宴得征字时封公兼鸿胪卿 · 岑参","name":"奉陪封大夫宴得征字时封公兼鸿胪卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西边虏尽平，何处更专征。\n幕下人无事，军中政已成。\n座参殊俗语，乐杂异方声。\n醉里东楼月，偏能照列卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}